=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Rahal} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} at (H-9) inside the Royal Knight Quarters as a {p:Dragoon} to begin this quest.
* Speak to {n:Ceraulian}, {z:Port San d'Oria} (I-10) inside Cargo Room A for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Ceraulian} once more after the cutscene.
* Obtain a {i:Kuftal Coffer Key|Kuftal Coffer Key|1051}. Use the key to open any coffer in {z:Kuftal Tunnel}. This will give you ({p:Key Item}): {k:Challenge to the Royal Knights}.
** Use a {p:Survival Guide} or UNM warp to reach the area.
* Return to {p:Rahal} and speak to him again.
* Speak to {n:Balasiel}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (F-7)
* Speak to {p:Rahal} again.
* Head to {z:Temple of Uggalepih} for a NM fight.
** NOTE: Make sure atleast one person present is on Dragoon as having a wyvern out is a requirement to spawn the NM. Other people can be on any job and still get the reward after the fight.
** The survival guide is most likely the fastest warp available
* Once inside, head to (F-10) on the first map to find a **???**.
** This spot is on a hidden area of the map at (F-9).

!Temple of Uggalepih-map1.jpg||Temple of Uggalepih map 1
* Click the **???** with your wyvern summoned to spawn two {p:NMs|NM}; {m:Cleuvarion M Resoaix} and {m:Rompaulion S Citalle}. The NMs will not spawn unless your wyvern is out with you.
** Only {m:Rompaulion S Citalle} needs to be defeated to continue.
** The battle can be handled with little difficulty at level 60 with a full party of Trusts.
* Once the NM's are dead, check the **???** again for a cutscene and your reward.

>**{c=red:Note}**:
* Although it is not necessarry, you can return to {n:Ceraulian} after defeating the NM's for an additional cutscene.
* {p:Rahal} will also have some additional dialogue for you after the fight.

